<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-10-23T22:26:01.508Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:26:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Indigenous Guard has taken up arms against the new president's agenda while President De la Espriella ordered a fifth bombing that killed nine ELN members, and a separate army bombing killed eight ELN fighters in the southwest. A car bomb at Casanare toll booths injured four women and a video shows the attack, and a drone strike at a Colombian police station injured six officers. Ecuador arrested four FARC dissident leaders on the border, linking cross-border rebel activity to the Colombian conflict. Colombia hosts a Regional Laboratory for Drone Warfare. There were 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPZlNzNUVOUHAyRWszSFZIUVd3cnhSalNPVGFIRUZhYUc1c1JldTRFYWRJSy05Z0ZEeEk0MjlxZ0o3Z3FVRTRtTnB5dzl5VE1NTXpUY2FVajRsRTJCOWpnZ052SXczN1E4c0JRZS1lcmZCR3hydXpJSEFqTjlqSkp0bTVqcXc1UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOY3k4cHo0TV9FUUFleHZFQUVHTkZZUDZ5STZqbm1VMW1kdlRtcVI3bjlvcjVTWVlKblo4N1JlTlNuTXlBWjVNWUV3eHM3ejc3c2xERzFadnFFRFBLbnZvWUxXNy15TVkta25ONTVzaHp3N2hhTHdld2x3bFVtUWNiZjd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNUUliTnZyN0haNXg4Rm5nRWlTeWtCZXN0Z1NONEo0TTZDVERnbFFOeXNvbS11bGZwa2liYXVvVFRiZFJXMUFhNUlDZWlqb3F3UnlCNHdVM1JwQTNqSWowQTBESVRvN3hEekR1WE55SlFQdVFEbnBieWE1RVY5VkdfWlRYdkNsNzZ5dWZ1TDRSbGYzZlZqQ3ZSTVNqVloyTTN1SFhockdVZkU0Z0F0TC01b1QxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQQkw4NWlvWFRwSE54b0pSUC1rUk1jeThDTjVjRmFnQXVlWUFENGNNUjhLb3NJNTg5OFVBQml3b0lhRnNTbnBuMjdESDkxQnlRTGQ2d0ltSUhGNEtwTDVmTW10ZjJ1NF9kU3BGSXpRM1ozLTdSWFZuLWhzNG1qWWFSR3dVaUFZX29jbVkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.